WEBVTT

01:38.210 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.090 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 30]

01:44.030 --> 01:48.360
[Dessert Shop]

01:48.430 --> 01:49.400
After we are done, let's go

01:49.400 --> 01:50.530
pick up our clothes.

01:50.920 --> 01:51.870
Let's wait a little longer.

01:51.870 --> 01:53.270
I'm waiting for someone.

01:56.039 --> 01:58.240
Physician Jiu, you were looking for me?

01:58.479 --> 01:59.120
Could you please

01:59.120 --> 01:59.850
deliver this

01:59.950 --> 02:01.610
to Lord Guan's residence

02:01.640 --> 02:02.760
at Huaijiang Alley in Shendu City?

02:02.760 --> 02:04.420
Shendu City, Huaijiang Alley, Lord Guan.

02:04.420 --> 02:05.090
Got it. Rest assured.

02:05.090 --> 02:06.070
I'll make sure it's delivered.

02:06.070 --> 02:07.200
Thank you very much.

02:12.190 --> 02:13.390
Who is Lord Guan?

02:14.430 --> 02:16.610
When I was in Shendu City on business years ago,

02:16.610 --> 02:17.980
I happened to run into Lord Guan

02:17.980 --> 02:19.280
who was being harassed by a demon.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.329
I helped him out,

02:20.360 --> 02:21.840
and that's how we got acquainted.

02:21.840 --> 02:24.100
So this time, you're writing to him to...

02:25.579 --> 02:26.710
To expose Xingxian.

02:29.340 --> 02:30.880
The one who brought Xingxian into the capital this time

02:30.880 --> 02:31.750
is the Vice Minister of Rites,

02:31.750 --> 02:33.120
a subordinate of Qin Xuanzhi.

02:33.120 --> 02:34.370
And this Lord Guan

02:34.400 --> 02:37.000
has a very good relationship with Qin Xuanzhi.

02:37.350 --> 02:40.380
Why are you exposing Xingxian?

02:42.150 --> 02:42.880
Shouldn't I?

02:45.030 --> 02:47.500
No... I just feel that...

02:50.000 --> 02:52.000
You think that because I'm a demon hunter,

02:52.000 --> 02:53.860
I might be biased towards humans?

02:55.560 --> 02:56.310
Everyone

02:56.329 --> 02:57.860
must face the consequences

02:57.870 --> 02:58.870
of their actions.

02:59.360 --> 03:01.590
We can't let good people suffer bad outcomes,

03:01.590 --> 03:04.030
nor can we let evil people reap good rewards.

03:04.030 --> 03:05.310
Demons must not hurt humans,

03:05.310 --> 03:07.150
but humans should also not bully demons.

03:07.150 --> 03:09.080
To achieve peaceful coexistence,

03:09.280 --> 03:11.480
it must not be a one-sided expectation.

03:13.710 --> 03:14.510
You're right.

03:19.680 --> 03:20.210
Let's go.

03:21.750 --> 03:22.150
Okay.

03:24.800 --> 03:25.400
Xuanye.

03:25.740 --> 03:27.590
Have you resolved that trouble that was

03:27.590 --> 03:28.450
bothering you?

03:29.190 --> 03:29.990
What trouble?

03:30.680 --> 03:31.560
It was when you suddenly

03:31.560 --> 03:33.240
seemed like a different person,

03:33.240 --> 03:35.280
and then you told me to tell you

03:35.750 --> 03:38.750
that you would definitely come back to find yourself.

03:38.840 --> 03:40.170
That has been resolved.

03:40.710 --> 03:41.190
So...

03:41.360 --> 03:42.560
was it another demon?

03:44.520 --> 03:45.720
Don't worry about it.

03:46.910 --> 03:48.240
I wasn't worried at all.

03:49.710 --> 03:51.240
Why didn't Chi Xue come along

03:51.240 --> 03:52.000
to enjoy something

03:52.000 --> 03:53.460
as delightful as dessert?

03:54.960 --> 03:56.690
He might be packing his things.

03:58.000 --> 03:58.910
Packing up?

04:00.000 --> 04:00.800
He's leaving.

04:01.500 --> 04:03.350
[A Land of Beauty and Blessing]

04:06.400 --> 04:07.200
What's wrong?

04:08.170 --> 04:09.700
Where... where is he going?

04:10.680 --> 04:12.680
He thinks I haven't been treating him well lately,

04:12.680 --> 04:14.410
so he's running away from home.

04:14.750 --> 04:16.610
Isn't that just causing trouble?

04:16.680 --> 04:17.880
And you agreed to him?

04:18.390 --> 04:19.589
That's just how he is.

04:19.680 --> 04:20.870
Sometimes when he's in the mood,

04:20.870 --> 04:22.670
he'll go out and play for a while.

04:22.830 --> 04:24.950
But isn't it dangerous for him to be running around

04:24.950 --> 04:26.070
all by himself?

04:27.040 --> 04:27.920
He's a demon,

04:28.470 --> 04:29.560
not a child.

04:29.830 --> 04:30.510
Yes,

04:31.250 --> 04:32.270
but what if he accidentally encounters

04:32.270 --> 04:33.630
other demon hunters?

04:33.800 --> 04:36.000
That demon hunter surnamed Jiang last time

04:36.000 --> 04:37.659
almost caught him, didn't he?

04:39.510 --> 04:41.440
You don't want him to leave, do you?

04:44.310 --> 04:45.510
At Eight Pillar Sect,

04:45.600 --> 04:47.190
while we may have our demon-controlling techniques,

04:47.190 --> 04:48.560
neither my father nor I have used them on

04:48.560 --> 04:49.360
Chi Xue.

04:50.430 --> 04:53.000
Chi Xue was raised by my father since he was young.

04:53.000 --> 04:54.460
We all treat him as family.

04:55.310 --> 04:56.970
So whether he stays or leaves,

04:57.120 --> 04:59.120
we are all respectful of his choice.

04:59.750 --> 05:00.350
Moreover,

05:00.870 --> 05:01.750
he is a demon.

05:02.430 --> 05:04.190
He will leave me sooner or later.

05:04.190 --> 05:05.590
Why does he have to leave?

05:05.820 --> 05:06.920
Why can't humans and demons

05:06.920 --> 05:07.830
stay together?

05:08.240 --> 05:09.120
You said it yourself

05:09.120 --> 05:10.920
that we can coexist peacefully.

05:16.750 --> 05:17.950
What I mean is,

05:18.700 --> 05:19.970
can't good friends like you and Chi Xue

05:19.970 --> 05:21.500
continue to stay together?

05:21.870 --> 05:22.800
Even friends don't need to

05:22.800 --> 05:24.200
be together all the time.

05:24.510 --> 05:26.040
Everyone has their own path.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.570
Forcing us to stay together

05:28.040 --> 05:29.570
may cause trouble instead.

05:34.390 --> 05:34.920
Alright,

05:35.070 --> 05:37.070
let's go to the tailor shop quickly.

05:48.750 --> 05:49.310
Sir.

05:51.870 --> 05:52.390
My Lady,

05:52.600 --> 05:53.330
you're here.

05:54.430 --> 05:56.090
I'm here to pick up my clothes.

05:56.240 --> 05:57.159
I knew you would

05:57.190 --> 05:58.420
come to pick them up today.

05:58.420 --> 06:00.420
They were just finished last night.

06:00.470 --> 06:01.600
Please go in and try them on.

06:01.600 --> 06:02.920
If there's anything that doesn't fit,

06:02.920 --> 06:04.560
I'll alter it for you right away.

06:04.560 --> 06:06.160
Thank you for your hard work.

06:06.680 --> 06:08.480
I'll go in and try on the clothes.

06:08.510 --> 06:09.440
Give me a moment.

06:10.480 --> 06:11.010
Alright.

06:12.460 --> 06:13.190
Sir,

06:13.220 --> 06:14.360
please feel free to look around.

06:14.360 --> 06:15.510
The fabrics in my shop

06:15.510 --> 06:16.600
are all new arrivals.

06:16.600 --> 06:17.600
If you find anything you like,

06:17.600 --> 06:20.000
why not tailor something for yourself too?

08:47.790 --> 08:48.390
Tingzhou!

08:48.650 --> 08:49.940
Quick, fetch some water for me.

08:49.940 --> 08:51.540
I'm going to find Xuanye now.

09:05.200 --> 09:07.770
[Ganshan Clinic]

09:10.550 --> 09:11.130
Xuanye.

09:13.940 --> 09:14.630
Xuanye?

09:20.150 --> 09:20.790
Xuanye!

09:25.150 --> 09:26.000
Chi Xue.

09:27.440 --> 09:28.130
Chi Xue!

09:28.720 --> 09:29.200
Chi Xue!

09:29.790 --> 09:30.390
Chi Xue!

09:33.000 --> 09:33.650
Chi Xue?

09:38.750 --> 09:39.440
Banxia?

09:39.900 --> 09:41.500
Yes, it's me. What happened?

09:41.740 --> 09:42.600
Why are you lying here?

09:42.600 --> 09:43.460
Get up quickly.

09:48.840 --> 09:49.640
It was a demon.

09:50.360 --> 09:51.060
A big demon!

09:51.510 --> 09:53.040
A big demon came last night.

09:54.470 --> 09:56.400
It was a very powerful demon beast.

09:57.040 --> 09:58.360
It had immense strength.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.890
It knocked me unconscious.

10:01.290 --> 10:02.350
What about Xuanye?

10:03.210 --> 10:03.940
I don't know.

10:48.360 --> 10:49.160
You're awake.

11:00.400 --> 11:01.380
It's you.

11:06.760 --> 11:07.690
You remember me?

11:07.890 --> 11:09.150
Although the exchange

11:09.440 --> 11:10.330
the other day

11:10.360 --> 11:11.220
was very brief,

11:12.000 --> 11:13.330
I remembered your face.

11:14.960 --> 11:16.050
You're a lucky man.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.690
I can't believe you didn't die.

11:20.550 --> 11:22.680
You've really forgotten everything.

11:22.870 --> 11:23.800
It seems that...

11:24.240 --> 11:25.970
not only do you not remember me,

11:26.490 --> 11:28.350
you've even forgotten yourself.

11:30.120 --> 11:30.630
Xuanye.

11:31.300 --> 11:33.030
That's your name now, isn't it?

11:34.190 --> 11:35.520
Are you happy as a human?

11:35.850 --> 11:37.050
Have you ever thought

11:37.360 --> 11:38.870
what it would be like

11:39.360 --> 11:41.020
if you weren't a demon hunter,

11:41.240 --> 11:42.310
but a demon instead?

11:42.310 --> 11:43.750
What are you talking about?

11:43.750 --> 11:44.680
Have you heard of

11:45.080 --> 11:46.140
the Carefree Land?

11:46.960 --> 11:48.480
It is a wondrous and ethereal land

11:48.480 --> 11:49.880
beyond the mortal realm.

11:50.450 --> 11:51.240
I don't want to stay here

11:51.240 --> 11:52.560
listening to your stories.

11:52.560 --> 11:54.960
I'm not interested in telling stories either.

11:54.960 --> 11:56.220
But as a demon hunter,

11:57.030 --> 11:59.840
aren't you curious about where all the demons in the world

11:59.840 --> 12:00.720
come from?

12:03.920 --> 12:04.730
Carefree Land

12:05.630 --> 12:06.950
is the mystical origin

12:07.290 --> 12:08.360
of the primordial spirit

12:08.360 --> 12:09.560
of countless demons.

12:10.600 --> 12:11.460
Every 12 years,

12:11.790 --> 12:14.550
the Carefree Grass releases the primordial spirit within the realm.

12:14.550 --> 12:16.720
At that time, the secret realm opens,

12:17.360 --> 12:19.270
connecting the human and demon worlds,

12:19.270 --> 12:20.720
so that the primordial spirit can be dispersed

12:20.720 --> 12:21.780
and live on its own.

12:22.270 --> 12:23.720
Regardless of birds, beasts,

12:23.720 --> 12:25.250
or even ancient artifacts,

12:25.390 --> 12:27.010
once it catches hold of the primordial spirit,

12:27.010 --> 12:28.630
its consciousness will be awakened

12:28.630 --> 12:29.890
and it becomes a demon.

12:30.350 --> 12:31.550
This is the origins of

12:31.790 --> 12:32.890
the demon clan.

12:33.270 --> 12:34.330
Such a secret realm

12:34.410 --> 12:35.870
cannot be left unguarded.

12:35.990 --> 12:37.030
That’s why the strongest of the demon clan,

12:37.030 --> 12:40.240
the Mystic Panther Clan, has been safeguarding it for generations.

12:40.240 --> 12:42.840
And the Supreme Master of the Mystic Panther Clan

12:42.840 --> 12:43.720
is my father,

12:44.360 --> 12:45.000
Yue Yan.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.150
And you

12:47.180 --> 12:48.580
are also my father's son,

12:49.000 --> 12:50.440
my half-brother.

12:51.390 --> 12:52.590
Your name is Man Ying.

12:56.120 --> 12:57.580
You're saying I'm a demon?

12:57.670 --> 12:58.470
That's right.

12:59.510 --> 13:00.510
Twelve years ago,

13:01.120 --> 13:02.360
to save a little girl,

13:03.120 --> 13:04.670
you violated the rules of our clan

13:04.670 --> 13:07.070
and have since been lost in the human world.

13:07.480 --> 13:08.150
Now, as the Carefree Land

13:08.150 --> 13:09.410
is about to open again,

13:09.790 --> 13:12.000
I've come to the human world to look for you in advance.

13:12.000 --> 13:14.060
I am precisely here to bring you back.

13:15.120 --> 13:15.790
Actually, before I came,

13:15.790 --> 13:17.390
I thought about many things.

13:17.480 --> 13:19.480
I thought about how you might refuse

13:19.720 --> 13:21.180
or be unwilling to return.

13:21.510 --> 13:22.870
I even thought about how you might have

13:22.870 --> 13:24.730
your own valid reasons and logic.

13:25.540 --> 13:26.670
But I never imagined

13:26.670 --> 13:27.870
it would be like this.

13:28.910 --> 13:30.720
You've actually lost your memory.

13:30.720 --> 13:32.510
You had even forgotten about your supreme mission

13:32.510 --> 13:34.510
and responsibilities completely.

13:34.890 --> 13:36.120
How ridiculous.

13:37.870 --> 13:39.200
Listen to me carefully.

13:39.720 --> 13:40.270
I

13:40.630 --> 13:41.890
was born in Guangping.

13:42.120 --> 13:43.320
I have my own parents.

13:43.720 --> 13:45.200
I am a demon hunter from the Ganshan Clinic,

13:45.200 --> 13:46.830
and the successor of the Eight Pillar Sect.

13:46.830 --> 13:47.490
I am not some

13:47.510 --> 13:49.600
panther demon you've been talking about.

13:49.600 --> 13:51.200
As a member of the demon clan,

13:51.450 --> 13:53.500
not only did you become a demon hunter,

13:53.500 --> 13:55.200
but you had even accepted incompetent mortals

13:55.200 --> 13:56.130
as your parents.

13:56.750 --> 13:57.410
Well, well.

13:58.600 --> 13:59.460
How wonderful.

14:00.670 --> 14:02.270
Should I praise you for that?

14:05.430 --> 14:06.240
I won't allow you

14:06.240 --> 14:07.590
to insult my parents.

14:08.080 --> 14:08.750
Parents?

14:09.720 --> 14:12.130
It seems nothing I say will make a difference.

14:12.130 --> 14:13.730
You won't believe me anyway.

14:19.120 --> 14:20.120
I won't fight you.

14:21.030 --> 14:22.090
The way you are now,

14:22.600 --> 14:24.400
even if I forcibly take you back,

14:24.600 --> 14:25.870
it would be meaningless.

14:25.870 --> 14:26.600
But you can't fool

14:26.600 --> 14:28.060
yourself for much longer.

14:28.360 --> 14:29.960
You should be able to feel it.

14:32.670 --> 14:34.800
And I'm also curious about something.

14:34.800 --> 14:36.330
If your family and friends

14:36.600 --> 14:37.800
knew you were a demon,

14:38.480 --> 14:39.680
how would they react?

14:44.460 --> 14:45.990
Would they still

14:46.020 --> 14:46.670
accept you

14:47.630 --> 14:48.960
and trust you as before?

14:50.450 --> 14:51.360
I recently learned a saying

14:51.360 --> 14:52.460
in the human world

14:53.150 --> 14:54.550
that makes a lot of sense.

14:55.720 --> 14:57.630
It says, "Those who are not of our kind

14:57.630 --> 14:59.000
cannot be trusted."

15:08.480 --> 15:10.080
Cherish your time as a human.

15:11.200 --> 15:12.460
I'll come back for you.

15:26.420 --> 15:27.030
Banxia?

15:27.110 --> 15:28.070
What brings you here?

15:28.070 --> 15:29.470
Xuanye has disappeared.

15:29.790 --> 15:31.590
What do you mean by disappeared?

15:31.610 --> 15:32.440
We had agreed to go

15:32.440 --> 15:34.100
to the market together today.

15:34.120 --> 15:35.240
But I just went to Ganshan Clinic,

15:35.240 --> 15:36.370
and he wasn't there.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.840
How is that considered disappearing?

15:39.840 --> 15:40.270
Not being at home

15:40.270 --> 15:41.870
may just mean he had gone out.

15:42.240 --> 15:42.760
Taverns, teahouses,

15:42.760 --> 15:43.750
the theaters and dance troupes.

15:43.750 --> 15:44.550
Have you searched these places?

15:44.550 --> 15:45.080
No,

15:45.360 --> 15:46.600
it's mainly because Chi Xue said

15:46.600 --> 15:47.510
a demon beast had entered

15:47.510 --> 15:49.040
Ganshan Clinic yesterday.

15:49.630 --> 15:50.430
A demon beast?

15:51.590 --> 15:52.790
What kind of demon beast?

15:52.790 --> 15:54.050
Why are you here again?

15:54.720 --> 15:55.870
I'm here to see Lord Geng.

15:55.870 --> 15:57.730
Do I need to notify you in advance?

15:59.960 --> 16:00.570
Go on,

16:00.600 --> 16:01.660
what kind of demon beast?

16:01.660 --> 16:03.190
Chi Xue didn't give details.

16:03.190 --> 16:05.510
He just said... it was a beast,

16:05.670 --> 16:06.760
and that it was very strong.

16:06.760 --> 16:07.950
How is Chi Xue now?

16:08.240 --> 16:09.320
He's fine.

16:09.520 --> 16:10.200
It seems that demon beast

16:10.200 --> 16:11.930
only knocked him unconscious.

16:12.600 --> 16:13.590
So you're saying

16:14.270 --> 16:15.960
Chi Xue didn't see Xuanye

16:16.070 --> 16:17.400
fight that demon beast?

16:17.670 --> 16:18.470
No, he didn't.

16:21.080 --> 16:22.940
Then you must be overthinking it.

16:23.420 --> 16:24.310
Xuanye is someone who can come and go

16:24.310 --> 16:25.120
as he pleases at the Underground City.

16:25.120 --> 16:26.780
He shouldn't be in any danger.

16:27.310 --> 16:27.960
He must have

16:27.960 --> 16:29.560
gone after that demon beast.

16:29.600 --> 16:31.860
There's no harm waiting a little longer.

16:31.870 --> 16:32.600
How about...

16:33.150 --> 16:34.610
You go home and wait first?

16:35.480 --> 16:36.080
Alright.

16:37.080 --> 16:38.190
I'll be going then.

16:38.510 --> 16:39.480
If there's any news,

16:39.480 --> 16:40.480
I'll let you know.

16:42.670 --> 16:43.870
Don't worry too much.

17:08.550 --> 17:09.160
Xuanye!

17:10.640 --> 17:11.589
Where did you go?

17:11.619 --> 17:13.550
I've been looking for you for ages.

17:14.400 --> 17:15.599
I didn't go anywhere.

17:15.849 --> 17:17.829
Chi Xue said a demon beast got into the house.

17:17.829 --> 17:18.890
Did you go after it?

17:24.349 --> 17:25.079
Demon beast?

17:25.200 --> 17:25.680
Yes.

17:26.109 --> 17:27.960
He said that demon beast was very powerful.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.560
It knocked him out in one hit.

17:29.680 --> 17:31.280
You weren't home last night?

17:34.310 --> 17:35.720
Let me go ask Chi Xue first.

17:35.720 --> 17:37.250
-I’ll go with you.
-No need.

17:37.850 --> 17:38.850
You go home first.

17:39.310 --> 17:40.510
I'll go ask him first.

17:51.440 --> 17:51.900
Xuanye!

17:52.950 --> 17:53.680
You're back.

17:54.880 --> 17:55.500
Chi Xue.

17:56.890 --> 17:58.610
Banxia said last night,

17:59.030 --> 18:00.890
a demon beast came into our house.

18:01.640 --> 18:02.370
Is that true?

18:05.510 --> 18:07.480
What kind of demon beast was it?

18:08.880 --> 18:09.390
It...

18:09.640 --> 18:10.570
was very fast

18:11.000 --> 18:11.930
and very strong.

18:12.170 --> 18:12.960
Before I could react,

18:12.960 --> 18:14.270
I was already knocked out.

18:14.270 --> 18:15.870
I didn't get a good look at it.

18:17.510 --> 18:18.510
You didn't see it?

18:19.030 --> 18:20.560
I thought you went after it.

18:24.200 --> 18:24.720
Xuanye.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.310
I won't leave just yet.

18:26.310 --> 18:27.460
That demon beast is not easy to deal with.

18:27.460 --> 18:28.660
I'll stay to help you.

18:32.030 --> 18:32.470
Okay.

18:50.160 --> 18:51.360
Have you ever thought

18:51.720 --> 18:53.070
what it would be like

18:53.750 --> 18:55.350
if you weren't a demon hunter

18:55.510 --> 18:56.640
but a demon instead?

19:24.790 --> 19:25.920
These are Moon Bugs.

19:27.750 --> 19:30.350
They feed on primordial spirit and moonlight.

19:31.110 --> 19:32.550
Some clever deception

19:33.240 --> 19:34.170
can fool people,

19:34.510 --> 19:36.170
but they can't fool Moon Bugs.

19:36.350 --> 19:37.080
That's why

19:37.440 --> 19:38.770
they have another name.

19:39.130 --> 19:41.790
They are also known as the eyes of demon hunters.

19:44.830 --> 19:46.410
So are there any other ways

19:46.440 --> 19:48.240
one can deceive these Moon Bugs?

19:49.720 --> 19:50.250
Very few.

20:25.590 --> 20:27.800
These... these are all cut out?

20:28.200 --> 20:29.400
Such skillful hands!

20:30.110 --> 20:32.190
Of course, it can't be chewed out, right?

20:32.190 --> 20:33.880
You should learn from them, Commissioner.

20:33.880 --> 20:35.030
Those are real girls' hands.

20:35.030 --> 20:35.690
Unlike you,

20:35.830 --> 20:37.830
who only knows how to fight and kill.

20:41.920 --> 20:42.480
Banxia,

20:43.030 --> 20:44.300
what are you cutting?

20:45.680 --> 20:46.280
Let me see.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.240
It's obvious.

20:52.480 --> 20:53.190
It's me.

20:54.550 --> 20:55.010
This...

20:55.400 --> 20:56.970
This is clearly a cat, isn't it?

20:56.970 --> 20:58.500
Did... did you cut out a cat?

20:59.580 --> 21:01.180
That looks like a tiger to me.

21:01.400 --> 21:02.160
I think...

21:02.830 --> 21:04.290
that looks like a panther.

21:06.010 --> 21:06.610
Oh, right.

21:06.790 --> 21:07.720
Where's Xuanye?

21:08.030 --> 21:08.690
He went out.

21:09.350 --> 21:10.210
Where did he go?

21:11.030 --> 21:11.750
I don't know.

21:11.750 --> 21:13.350
I haven't seen him since early this morning.

21:13.350 --> 21:14.880
On such an important day...

21:15.030 --> 21:16.590
Why did Xuanye go out at a time like this?

21:16.590 --> 21:17.270
Exactly.

21:20.000 --> 21:21.530
You've got such a big mouth.

21:21.690 --> 21:22.310
So much nonsense.

21:22.310 --> 21:23.350
Nothing to do at the government office,

21:23.350 --> 21:24.680
so they let you gossip here?

21:24.680 --> 21:26.210
I'm just making small talk.

21:31.680 --> 21:32.140
Xuanye.

21:32.840 --> 21:33.970
Where have you been?

21:36.090 --> 21:38.090
I went out to take care of something.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.070
Xuanye.

21:40.030 --> 21:41.630
Were you out to catch a demon?

21:42.070 --> 21:43.490
Was it the one Chi Xue mentioned

21:43.490 --> 21:44.550
that broke into your house two nights ago?

21:44.550 --> 21:45.550
That demon beast?

21:46.790 --> 21:47.520
Yes, indeed.

21:51.350 --> 21:52.000
Any leads?

21:52.960 --> 21:53.480
Not yet.

21:55.640 --> 21:56.370
Don't worry.

21:56.920 --> 21:58.680
Lord Geng is already aware of this matter.

21:58.680 --> 22:00.160
I've also notified the hunters outside the city.

22:00.160 --> 22:01.830
Once they spot any trace of that demon beast,

22:01.830 --> 22:04.120
they'll report to the government office immediately.

22:04.120 --> 22:05.040
That's a demon.

22:05.070 --> 22:07.000
What's the use of finding hunters?

22:07.310 --> 22:08.570
So what if it's a demon?

22:08.680 --> 22:10.590
It can't even transform into human form.

22:10.590 --> 22:12.540
That means it's not as powerful as Chi Xue.

22:12.540 --> 22:13.860
Why can't hunters handle it?

22:13.860 --> 22:14.980
It's not as powerful as Chi Xue?

22:14.980 --> 22:16.830
It knocked Chi Xue out in one hit.

22:16.850 --> 22:18.880
That only proves it has brute strength.

22:18.880 --> 22:20.110
You have brute strength too, don't you?

22:20.110 --> 22:20.970
Can you beat me?

22:21.840 --> 22:22.700
Right, Xuanye?

22:30.400 --> 22:30.920
Xuanye.

22:35.070 --> 22:37.130
Did you really go to catch that demon?

22:38.350 --> 22:38.950
Yes, I did.

22:40.600 --> 22:42.660
Chi Xue said that demon is very powerful.

22:42.660 --> 22:43.120
Do you want to

22:43.120 --> 22:44.160
ask for more help?

22:45.270 --> 22:46.000
It's fine.

22:46.440 --> 22:46.920
No need.

22:58.790 --> 22:59.510
Xuanye.

23:01.310 --> 23:02.180
Tomorrow, the two of us

23:02.180 --> 23:03.510
are going to be engaged.

23:04.000 --> 23:06.260
You'll be a man with a family from then on.

23:06.750 --> 23:08.480
So no matter what you do,

23:09.070 --> 23:09.870
you can't be as reckless

23:09.870 --> 23:10.680
as you were before.

23:10.680 --> 23:11.510
Do you hear me?

23:13.270 --> 23:14.070
I understand.

23:15.680 --> 23:17.110
You look so tired.

23:18.240 --> 23:20.570
Why don't you lie down and rest for a while?

23:23.350 --> 23:23.950
Alright.

23:49.640 --> 23:52.030
The Supreme Master of the Mystic Panther Clan

23:52.030 --> 23:52.960
is my father,

23:53.550 --> 23:54.110
Yue Yan.

23:54.750 --> 23:55.270
And you

23:55.710 --> 23:57.110
are also my father's son,

23:57.550 --> 23:58.830
my half-brother,

23:59.030 --> 23:59.890
named Man Ying.

24:00.750 --> 24:02.210
You're saying I'm a demon?

24:02.590 --> 24:03.390
That's right.

24:35.790 --> 24:36.270
Xuanye!

24:38.090 --> 24:38.720
Xuanye!

24:39.960 --> 24:40.600
Xuanye!

24:40.860 --> 24:41.750
Xuanye, are you okay?

24:41.750 --> 24:42.240
Xuanye!

24:48.910 --> 24:49.660
Xuanye!

25:02.720 --> 25:03.310
Xuanye!

25:03.830 --> 25:04.400
Xuanye!

25:25.050 --> 25:26.250
Have you seen Xuan...

25:26.260 --> 25:30.390
P-Panther...

25:31.110 --> 25:32.670
It's a panther!

25:38.120 --> 25:41.560
Panther! It's a panther!

25:44.240 --> 25:45.020
Have you heard?

25:45.020 --> 25:47.070
There was another demon sighting last night.

25:47.070 --> 25:47.590
Really?

25:47.920 --> 25:49.270
Someone saw it with their own eyes.

25:49.270 --> 25:51.000
They said it was a black panther demon.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.130
There really are demons in this world.

25:52.130 --> 25:53.120
Of course there are.

25:53.120 --> 25:54.920
My brother-in-law is a clerk at the government office.

25:54.920 --> 25:55.720
I heard from him

25:55.720 --> 25:58.250
that Lord Geng has started capturing demons.

26:09.640 --> 26:10.460
My Lady.

26:10.860 --> 26:11.790
We are just paying taxes today.

26:11.790 --> 26:13.170
You don't even need to be personally there.

26:13.170 --> 26:14.970
Why are you dolling yourself up?

26:15.440 --> 26:16.640
Why else do you think I'm getting all

26:16.640 --> 26:17.300
dressed up?

26:19.660 --> 26:21.060
Physician Jiu is coming?

26:23.440 --> 26:24.700
We received the letter

26:24.720 --> 26:26.120
and rushed to Guangping.

26:26.960 --> 26:27.960
I didn’t expect to

26:28.160 --> 26:30.220
run into yet another happy occasion.

26:31.350 --> 26:31.950
Yingheng,

26:32.160 --> 26:33.960
this is what they call surviving a great ordeal and

26:33.960 --> 26:36.420
being blessed with good fortune afterward.

26:37.720 --> 26:39.310
Father couldn't believe it at first.

26:39.310 --> 26:41.250
He kept confirming on the way here

26:41.330 --> 26:44.400
if it was really your handwritten letter, Uncle Yingheng.

26:44.400 --> 26:45.130
This matter,

26:45.620 --> 26:46.950
indeed, is too bizarre.

26:47.480 --> 26:49.400
If we hadn't experienced it ourselves,

26:49.400 --> 26:50.360
no matter who said it,

26:50.360 --> 26:52.820
we wouldn't have dared to believe it easily.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.310
You know,

26:56.350 --> 26:57.480
that girl Banxia,

26:58.110 --> 27:00.200
who usually looks so delicate and fragile,

27:00.200 --> 27:01.060
I never thought

27:01.230 --> 27:02.430
she would be so brave.

27:03.320 --> 27:05.320
That's all thanks to Physician Jiu.

27:05.830 --> 27:07.510
Otherwise, with her abilities alone,

27:07.510 --> 27:09.510
how could she have fought against a demon?

27:09.510 --> 27:10.790
Still calling him Physician Jiu?

27:10.790 --> 27:12.650
He's already our son-in-law now.

27:14.720 --> 27:15.200
Yanqiu.

27:15.430 --> 27:16.360
Uncle Yingheng.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.750
I heard from Banxia

27:18.160 --> 27:20.490
that you're also acquainted with Xuanye.

27:21.400 --> 27:21.790
Yes,

27:22.200 --> 27:23.440
he saved me previously.

27:23.440 --> 27:24.770
He's a reliable person.

27:24.920 --> 27:26.310
Banxia's making the right choice

27:26.310 --> 27:27.240
by marrying him.

27:41.640 --> 27:42.240
Tingzhou.

27:42.550 --> 27:43.510
Is it time yet?

27:46.920 --> 27:48.380
It should be time already.

27:50.270 --> 27:51.070
I'll go check.

27:53.550 --> 27:54.310
Don't worry.

27:54.750 --> 27:55.750
In his household,

27:55.750 --> 27:56.880
there are no elders,

27:57.000 --> 27:59.860
so it's understandable if things are a bit chaotic.

28:00.590 --> 28:00.960
Yes.

28:04.030 --> 28:04.430
Uncle.

28:05.000 --> 28:06.400
Banxia, why are you here?

28:06.750 --> 28:08.280
Hasn't Xuanye arrived yet?

28:09.030 --> 28:11.230
Yanqiu has already gone to look for him.

28:12.290 --> 28:12.950
I'll go too.

28:13.960 --> 28:14.480
Banxia.

28:15.030 --> 28:15.510
Banxia!

28:15.920 --> 28:17.200
-Xuanye!
-Xuanye!

28:17.270 --> 28:17.830
Chi Xue!

28:20.200 --> 28:20.720
Xuanye!

28:21.110 --> 28:21.610
Open the door!

28:21.610 --> 28:22.940
What time is it already?

28:23.830 --> 28:24.310
Yanqiu.

28:24.330 --> 28:24.810
Banxia.

28:25.550 --> 28:26.750
When did you get here?

28:26.750 --> 28:27.880
We just got here too.

28:28.160 --> 28:30.380
There was a demon causing trouble around here yesterday.

28:30.380 --> 28:31.440
What kind of demon?

28:31.440 --> 28:33.500
They say it was a black panther demon.

28:39.470 --> 28:40.530
Kick the door open.

28:50.350 --> 28:51.550
-Xuanye!
-Xuanye!

28:52.480 --> 28:53.070
Xuanye!

28:53.550 --> 28:54.830
-Xuanye!
-Xuanye!

28:56.070 --> 28:56.860
Let's split up.

28:56.860 --> 28:57.800
Search every corner.

28:57.800 --> 28:58.330
Alright.

28:58.640 --> 28:59.350
Xuanye!

29:14.880 --> 29:15.720
Did you find him?

29:15.720 --> 29:16.110
No.

29:17.270 --> 29:17.880
My Lady.

29:19.920 --> 29:21.400
The back door is open.

29:22.110 --> 29:23.070
Then let's go outside.

29:23.070 --> 29:24.530
Let's split up and search.

29:54.400 --> 29:57.530
Scented sachets, pouches and little trinkets for sale!

30:30.200 --> 30:31.350
Chief Constable Chu.

30:31.350 --> 30:32.640
Have you found Xuanye?

30:34.920 --> 30:36.450
Xuanye might be in trouble.

30:37.270 --> 30:38.330
I've confirmed it.

30:38.540 --> 30:39.440
Last night, a few more people

30:39.440 --> 30:40.640
saw that demon beast.

30:40.760 --> 30:41.310
He and Chi Xue

30:41.310 --> 30:43.000
might have gone to exorcise the demon.

30:43.000 --> 30:44.400
What kind of demon beast?

30:45.000 --> 30:46.030
They say it's

30:46.750 --> 30:48.010
a black panther demon.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.270
My Lady.

30:50.660 --> 30:51.170
Banxia.

30:51.680 --> 30:52.480
What's wrong?

30:55.350 --> 30:55.880
Banxia.

30:56.600 --> 30:57.860
Do you know something?

30:58.480 --> 31:00.210
Have you seen that demon beast?

31:03.790 --> 31:04.310
Banxia.

31:08.960 --> 31:09.510
Banxia.

31:10.920 --> 31:11.650
Don't worry.

31:11.790 --> 31:13.320
Xuanye is a capable person.

31:13.510 --> 31:14.830
Even if that demon beast is powerful,

31:14.830 --> 31:16.170
it surely can't do anything to him.

31:16.170 --> 31:16.960
Chief Constable Wen and your brother

31:16.960 --> 31:18.070
have already left the city.

31:18.070 --> 31:19.800
We'll continue searching too.

31:20.750 --> 31:21.280
Why don't

31:22.200 --> 31:23.130
you go home first

31:23.200 --> 31:24.400
and wait for our news?

31:26.270 --> 31:27.060
My Lady.

31:27.680 --> 31:28.280
Tingzhou.

31:30.550 --> 31:31.320
My Lady.

31:33.920 --> 31:34.920
My Lady, let's go.

31:41.590 --> 31:43.520
Don't you think it's a bit strange?

31:43.880 --> 31:44.810
What's strange?

31:46.190 --> 31:47.960
When I was in Shendu previously,

31:47.960 --> 31:49.160
I encountered a demon

31:49.590 --> 31:51.120
that was related to Xuanye.

31:51.910 --> 31:54.370
Why haven't I heard you mention this before?

31:56.270 --> 31:58.530
Would you have listened if I had told you?

32:29.020 --> 32:30.220
Why are you bleeding?

32:31.400 --> 32:32.880
How... how did this happen?

32:32.880 --> 32:34.410
Xuanye might be in trouble.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.220
I've confirmed it.

32:36.550 --> 32:37.350
Several people last night

32:37.350 --> 32:38.720
saw that demon beast again.

32:38.720 --> 32:40.750
He and Chi Xue might have gone to exorcise the demon.

32:40.750 --> 32:41.750
What demon beast?

32:43.030 --> 32:43.790
They say it's

32:44.720 --> 32:45.980
a black panther demon.

33:54.030 --> 33:54.640
Who?

34:04.310 --> 34:04.940
My Lady.

34:05.590 --> 34:07.050
Tingzhou, who did you see?

34:07.350 --> 34:08.070
I just saw a figure

34:08.070 --> 34:09.550
standing over there.

34:10.340 --> 34:10.960
Xuanye?

34:11.230 --> 34:12.230
It must be Xuanye.

34:14.710 --> 34:15.280
Xuanye!

34:16.150 --> 34:16.710
Xuanye!

34:17.300 --> 34:18.340
Xuanye, come out!

34:18.550 --> 34:19.219
Xuanye!

34:20.429 --> 34:21.010
Banxia!

34:21.230 --> 34:21.790
Banxia!

34:22.150 --> 34:22.949
What's wrong?

34:23.290 --> 34:23.889
Mother,

34:23.920 --> 34:25.219
Tingzhou saw Xuanye.

34:26.000 --> 34:26.920
I'm not certain either.

34:26.920 --> 34:27.920
I just saw...

34:27.920 --> 34:29.580
a figure standing over there.

34:37.400 --> 34:38.460
-Banxia!
-My Lady!

34:44.670 --> 34:45.360
Xuanye!

34:48.030 --> 34:48.710
Xuanye!

34:53.280 --> 34:54.020
Xuanye!

34:56.320 --> 34:57.110
Xuanye!

34:58.920 --> 34:59.590
Xuanye!

35:03.920 --> 35:05.440
Xuanye, stop joking around!

35:05.440 --> 35:06.370
Come out now!

35:07.880 --> 35:09.150
Come out right now!

35:13.510 --> 35:15.170
I'm really going to get angry!

35:24.680 --> 35:26.330
I will really get angry.

35:45.010 --> 35:48.530
♫Melody echoes along the river; wild geese soar in sudden fright♫

35:49.020 --> 35:51.700
♫The music ends, and I stand in solitude♫

35:53.330 --> 35:56.570
♫I see you turn into a handful of starlight♫

35:57.040 --> 36:00.880
♫Drifting past me♫

36:01.340 --> 36:05.130
♫In tears, the past memories still glow♫

36:05.490 --> 36:08.630
♫Crystallized into cold amber♫

36:08.790 --> 36:13.380
♫I know it also brought you great pain to let go♫

36:09.280 --> 36:10.030
I'm sorry.

36:10.960 --> 36:11.710
I'm sorry.

36:13.770 --> 36:15.780
♫But why did you♫

36:16.080 --> 36:20.380
♫Still endure the pain and shatter♫

36:16.110 --> 36:17.550
I'm really sorry.

36:20.720 --> 36:25.210
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

36:23.100 --> 36:24.280
Actually...

36:25.310 --> 36:28.990
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

36:26.230 --> 36:28.150
I already knew

36:28.170 --> 36:29.260
a long, long time ago,

36:29.260 --> 36:31.210
♫I hate that I failed♫

36:29.840 --> 36:30.440
But...

36:31.230 --> 36:36.550
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

36:32.280 --> 36:33.450
But I didn't know

36:33.480 --> 36:34.510
how to tell you.

36:34.580 --> 36:36.510
I was afraid you'd push me away.

36:36.930 --> 36:41.130
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

36:41.150 --> 36:46.020
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

36:44.670 --> 36:45.400
Xuanye.

36:45.440 --> 36:46.330
Xuanye, I...

36:46.790 --> 36:52.970
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

36:47.760 --> 36:48.800
I hate myself

36:48.820 --> 36:50.710
for not telling you earlier.

36:51.070 --> 36:52.550
I really don't care.

36:54.480 --> 36:55.320
I really...

36:55.760 --> 36:57.960
I really don't care!

37:04.400 --> 37:05.030
You...

37:13.370 --> 37:14.200
I was wrong.

37:14.230 --> 37:16.230
Can you come back?

37:17.280 --> 37:18.410
I'm sorry.

37:18.440 --> 37:20.070
It's all my fault.

37:22.360 --> 37:24.920
I'm... I'm sorry.

37:29.550 --> 37:30.920
I'm sorry.

37:32.840 --> 37:33.650
My Lady!

37:35.760 --> 37:36.340
Master!

37:36.370 --> 37:37.030
I think I hear

37:37.030 --> 37:38.030
Ms. Duan's voice.

37:39.230 --> 37:40.030
Master, look!

37:40.590 --> 37:41.290
Banxia!

37:41.320 --> 37:41.800
My Lady!

37:44.340 --> 37:45.230
I was wrong.

37:45.980 --> 37:50.170
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

37:46.760 --> 37:47.230
Banxia!

37:48.760 --> 37:49.220
My Lady!

37:49.590 --> 37:50.050
Banxia.

37:50.390 --> 37:54.270
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

37:52.510 --> 37:53.280
Come with me.

37:54.560 --> 37:56.480
♫I hate that I failed♫

37:54.710 --> 37:55.710
Come home with me.

37:56.510 --> 38:01.880
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

38:00.150 --> 38:01.080
Master, slowly.

38:02.220 --> 38:06.660
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

38:06.690 --> 38:11.400
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

38:11.940 --> 38:17.980
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

38:57.630 --> 38:58.190
Banxia.

38:59.110 --> 39:01.640
Have a bowl of ginger tea to keep the cold away.

39:19.480 --> 39:20.680
A letter from Xuanye.

39:20.890 --> 39:22.090
Do you want to read it?

39:31.940 --> 39:32.600
He says

39:33.280 --> 39:35.140
your marriage has been annulled.

39:35.630 --> 39:37.160
But he didn't give a reason.

39:38.760 --> 39:39.230
Banxia,

39:40.200 --> 39:41.410
do you know why?

39:49.420 --> 39:51.380
It's fine if you don't want to say.

39:52.720 --> 39:55.680
Although he's being fickle about this,

39:56.550 --> 39:57.350
but after all,

39:57.710 --> 39:59.360
he's our family's benefactor.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.160
I don't want to

40:00.230 --> 40:02.030
put too much blame on him either.

40:06.280 --> 40:07.560
I never wanted

40:07.590 --> 40:08.520
you to marry him.

40:08.550 --> 40:09.680
He's a demon hunter,

40:09.970 --> 40:11.510
dealing with demons every day.

40:11.510 --> 40:12.710
It's very dangerous.

40:13.120 --> 40:15.290
You're my only daughter.

40:16.400 --> 40:18.480
Our family was separated for 11 years.

40:18.480 --> 40:19.840
I don't want to see

40:19.970 --> 40:21.100
you in danger again.

40:26.380 --> 40:28.510
But all of you convinced me otherwise.

40:30.170 --> 40:31.500
I just didn't expect...

40:35.590 --> 40:36.790
Your mother's health

40:36.880 --> 40:38.140
has almost recovered.

40:38.510 --> 40:38.970
Banxia.

40:39.670 --> 40:41.400
Let's go back to Nanyang

40:41.710 --> 40:42.910
with Uncle together.

40:44.360 --> 40:46.220
Don't you miss your Grandmother?

40:46.320 --> 40:47.400
When she learned that

40:47.400 --> 40:49.070
your mother and I were still alive,

40:49.070 --> 40:50.610
she was so happy that she couldn't sleep

40:50.610 --> 40:51.740
for several nights.

40:52.110 --> 40:53.170
She's getting old.

40:53.630 --> 40:55.160
We should go back to see her.

41:01.880 --> 41:02.740
Some things...

41:03.190 --> 41:04.440
if you can't figure them out right away,

41:04.440 --> 41:05.770
just let them be for now.

41:07.360 --> 41:08.620
When the time is right,

41:08.920 --> 41:11.440
maybe a change will come.

41:15.110 --> 41:16.770
He doesn't want to see you now.

41:17.610 --> 41:18.870
There's no point in you

41:19.960 --> 41:21.220
staying here anymore.

41:40.000 --> 41:40.510
Banxia.

41:42.710 --> 41:43.320
Later,

41:44.700 --> 41:45.960
drink the ginger soup.

42:22.820 --> 42:23.400
Xuanye!

42:24.480 --> 42:25.500
I've finally found you.

42:25.500 --> 42:26.030
Chi Xue.

42:26.320 --> 42:26.960
Go away!

42:27.440 --> 42:28.240
I won't leave.

42:28.800 --> 42:29.880
How did you turn into a demon?

42:29.880 --> 42:30.340
Xuanye!

42:30.630 --> 42:31.110
Go!

42:31.670 --> 42:32.530
I can't control

42:32.550 --> 42:33.210
myself now.

42:33.630 --> 42:34.480
Go away!

42:34.920 --> 42:35.440
Xuanye!

42:36.920 --> 42:37.440
Xuanye!

42:47.030 --> 42:48.590
You were originally from the Mystic Panther Clan.
